# Optional. The admin app runs locally with no sign-in and no Firebase, so it
# needs no configuration: it reads and writes ../data and ../local-data (see
# data/README.md). Copy this file to .env.local only to override a default.

# Repo root holding data/, local-data/, scrape.py and .venv. Defaults to the
# parent of web/.
# CASPIAN_REPO_ROOT=
